          <a href="/players/180-records/" class="link-card">
            <h4>🔥 180 Maximum Records</h4>
            <p>All-time 180 records, tournament maximum counts, and historic scoring benchmarks.</p>
          </a>

          <a href="/tournament/world-darts-championship/" class="link-card">
            <h4>🏆 World Darts Championship Hub</h4>
            <p>Complete £5M tournament schedule, prize money breakdown, and spectator guides.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
